# The DATA of data/ are tracked by DVC (data.dvc); the CODE of the eqasim stages that lives
# under data/ (data/hts, data/spatial, data/bdtopo…) is tracked by git. Git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent folder is excluded: so we exclude the content
# (`/data/**`) then re-include the folders and the Python sources.
/data/**
!/data/**/
!/data/**/*.py
